Subject: [PATCH 1/4] r4 journey fix 1: journey water-material failure logs
 [QF_LAKE] journey-water-fallback (reason + asset path)

loadLakesideWaterAsset now rejects with the engine reason and path instead of
resolving null; the journey's catch logs one always-on [QF_LAKE] warn
(event journey-water-fallback, bundle, asset, reason) via
logLakesideJourneyWaterFallback and keeps the imported water look (no throw).
Cancellation still propagates and the success path prints nothing.
Test: lakeside-journey-water-fallback (material 404, no asset, bundle fail,
normal run, cancel, logger never throws, wiring).
